What this is

A governance-first Python project for a P2P "OneClick Evo" system that combines constitutional/architectural documentation, ontology and agent guidance with a codebase scaffold under src. It appears aimed at teams building a decentralized/peer-to-peer system where engineering process, autonomy zones, and trust/ontology are first-class artifacts.
Stack

    Language(s): Python (primary)
    Framework / runtime: Python 3.x (no application framework or runtime declared in repository files)
    Znaczące biblioteki: Żaden wyraźnie nie zadeklarowany w repozytorium (brak pyproject.toml lub requirements.txt znaleziony przy korzeniu repo). Lista zależności musi zostać dodana do plików manifestu, aby wybory runtime / biblioteki były wyraźne.

